dition and classic modes anywhere and at any time<br>\t\t\t</li></ul>Includes all new features<br>\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All new intuitive game interface and controls provide a more interactive gameplay experience<br>\t\t\t</li><li>In-game puzzle hint system keeps the puzzles fresh and fun\t\t<br>\t\t\t</li></ul>",
